  - id: brief.ask_gear
    stepId: brief
    stationId: mai
    nextStepId: brief
    label: "H\u1ECFi c\xF4 Mai v\u1EC1 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB v\xE0 m\u1EABu v\u1EADt l\u1EDBp 8A"
    tradeoff: "1 ph\xFAt \xB7 ki\u1EC3m tra th\xF4ng tin th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF v\u1EC1 ph\xF2ng h\u1ECDc v\xE0 m\xE1y chi\u1EBFu."
    feedback: "C\xF4 Mai: 'Ph\xF2ng 8A x\u1EBFp 4 c\u1EE5m b\xE0n. B\xF3ng \u0111\xE8n m\xE1y chi\u1EBFu chi\u1EC1u qua h\u01A1i ch\u1EADp ch\u1EDDn n\xEAn \u0111\u1EEBng ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c ho\xE0n to\xE0n v\xE0o slide; trong ph\xF2ng gi\xE1o vi\xEAn c\xF3 khay m\u1EABu \u0111\u1EA5t - g\u1EA1ch v\xE0 m\xE1y in.'"
    evidence: "Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u1ECFi t\xECnh tr\u1EA1ng thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB l\u1EDBp h\u1ECDc tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ch\u1ECDn h\u1ECDc li\u1EC7u."
