    label: "Nh\u1EADn ti\u1EBFt d\u1EA1y L\u1EDBp 8A v\xE0 v\xE0o Ph\xF2ng gi\xE1o vi\xEAn chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB"
    tradeoff: "2 ph\xFAt \xB7 sang Ph\xF2ng gi\xE1o vi\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc tr\u1ED1ng 07:30."
    feedback: "C\xF4 Mai: 'M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ti\u1EBFt 8A l\xE0 gi\xFAp c\xE1c nh\xF3m gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch v\xEC sao c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 s\xE2n \u0111\u1ECDng n\u01B0\u1EDBc sau m\u01B0a b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch quan s\xE1t v\xE0 so s\xE1nh m\u1EABu. H\xE3y xem b\xE0i c\u0169 v\xE0 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB h\u1ECDc li\u1EC7u trong ph\xF2ng gi\xE1o vi\xEAn nh\xE9.'"
    evidence: "X\xE1c nh\u1EADn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ti\u1EBFt h\u1ECDc KHTN L\u1EDBp 8A c\xF9ng gi\xE1o vi\xEAn h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn."
